<title>FRANCE: CYCLING-GERMANY'S ULLRICH WINS TOUR DE FRANCE.</title>
<headline>CYCLING-GERMANY'S ULLRICH WINS TOUR DE FRANCE.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-07-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Jan Ullrich of Germany won the Tour de France cycling classic on Sunday.</p>
<p>Richard Virenque of France, king of the mountains, was second and Italian Marco Pantani third.</p>
</text>
